-balling-them">6. Fold socks flat instead of balling them</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#7-roll-underwear-and-nest-bras">7. Roll underwear and nest bras</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-to-fold-towels-and-bedding-to-save-space">How to Fold Towels and Bedding to Save Space</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#8-fold-towels-in-thirds-then-roll-or-fold">8. Fold towels in thirds, then roll or fold</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#9-fold-a-fitted-sheet-and-store-sets-in-a-pillowcase">9. Fold a fitted sheet and store sets in a pillowcase</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-to-fold-clothes-to-save-space-in-luggage">How to Fold Clothes to Save Space in Luggage</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#10-use-the-ranger-roll-for-soft-clothes">10. Use the ranger roll for soft clothes</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#11-combine-folding-with-packing-cubes">11. Combine folding with packing cubes</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#12-fold-for-seasonal-storage">12. Fold for seasonal storage</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#common-folding-mistakes-that-waste-space">Common Folding Mistakes That Waste Space</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#frequently-asked-questions">Frequently Asked Questions</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#is-it-better-to-fold-or-roll-clothes-to-save-space">Is it better to fold or roll clothes to save space?</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#what-is-the-konmari-folding-method">What is the KonMari folding method?</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-do-you-fold-clothes-to-save-space-in-drawers">How do you fold clothes to save space in drawers?</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-do-i-fold-clothes-to-fit-more-in-a-suitcase">How do I fold clothes to fit more in a suitcase?</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#final-thoughts">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></div></nav>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Why Folding Upright Saves So Much Space</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The real trick is direction, not size. When clothes are stacked flat, you only see the top item, and the pile collapses every time you pull something from the middle. File folding, the method made popular by Marie Kondo&#8217;s KonMari approach, turns each piece into a firm little rectangle that stands on its edge. Rows of upright clothes use the full height of the drawer, stay neat when you remove one, and show you everything you own.</p>



